@startuml cd1_join_game
!include style.iuml
allowmixing
title CD-1  Join Game (UC-01) - communication diagram from SD-1
actor "p1 : Player" as P1
object "lobby : LobbyPage" as L
object "api : ApiClient" as A
object ": GameAPI" as API
object "svc : GameService" as S
object "rec : GameRecord" as R
object "page : GamePage" as G
P1 --> L : 1: startGame()
L --> A : 1.1: api("/api/lobby/join/", "POST")
A --> API : 1.1.1: POST /api/lobby/join/\n1.3.1*: GET /api/games/{id}/
API --> S : 1.1.1.1: joinOnlineGame(name, size)\n1.3.1.1*: pollGame(id, token)
S --> R : 1.1.1.1.1a [player waiting]: SD-1a pair players\n1.1.1.1.1b [no player waiting]: <<create>> status = waiting
A --> A : 1.1.2: saveSeat(id, token, colour)
L --> G : 1.2: <<create>> GamePage(id, token)
G --> A : 1.3* [every 1.5 s while waiting]: api(GET state)
G --> G : 1.4: render(state)
G --> P1 : 1.5: show board, colour, opponent
@enduml
